    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="966b507e-0f2a-5bbe-b586-d882672a4729" activityNameId="63991c50-b8a2-5c1b-9c55-d1296e4431f2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, at 100MW wind farm, onshore, 2.3MW turbines</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, at 100MW wind farm, onshore, 2.3MW turbines
UUID=79a7b7d6-d0eb-48f2-bae7-da98facdae0f
Electricity from wind farm, fed to grid. Includes the operation of the wind farm with the necessary change of gear oil.
100MW wind farm, consisting of 43 onshore wind turbines Enercon E-82, of 2.3MW each.
Model is based on the capacity factor of 23.5%, representing the average capacity factor of onshore wind farms in Europe between 2016-2024 (source: ENTSO-E).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years. Annual electricity production is 206 GWh, applying a capacity factor of 23.5%.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_79a7b7d6-d0eb-48f2-bae7-da98facdae0f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
